istribute it for non-commercial or for commercial purposes</li>\n<li>Create derivative works of it</li></ul>\n<p><b>Under this condition</b>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Credit me as the original author and use the same license. To do so add \"<i><b>Diego Delso, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://delso.photo\">delso.photo</a>, License <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode\">CC BY-SA</a></b></i>\" legibly next to the image.</li></ul>\n<p>Please, use this work legally fulfilling the terms of the license!\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Please, let me know <b>if you use this work outside Wikimedia Commons</b> sending me an email on <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:UserIconMail.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/UserIconMail.svg/40px-UserIconMail.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/UserIconMail.svg/60px-UserIconMail.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"700\"></a></span> <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:EmailUser/Poco_a_poco\" title=\"Special:EmailUser/Poco a poco\">Poco a poco</a> or to diego(at)delso.photo with reference to the URL in the case of a website or to the ISBN/author/title in the case of a printed work or eBook. I am always very glad if you consider to send me a copy of the publication or a promocode for the eBook as gratitude for using my works. Note: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:No_Facebook.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/No_Facebook.svg/60px-No_Facebook.svg.